      {"id": "execute", "label": "双执行运行时", "focus": ["pending", "sidecar", "ansible"], "note": "两个 runtime 共享 JobExecution，却采用不同选路、结果收集与失败恢复语义。"},
      {"id": "complete", "label": "终态与副作用", "focus": ["sidecar", "ansible", "direct", "transactional", "effects"], "note": "Sidecar 和早退走 direct finalize；Ansible 回调走受认证的事务终态与 Outbox。"}
